  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称；|103|＝按玩家性别变化的敬称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35026001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "喵呜，喵——我们到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "就是这里，我不会记错的，喵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "说好的，不会让家里的手办们看到我……喵？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "怎么了，粮丸？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "是不是还没习惯以这副样子出现在老友们的面前。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "不要紧，粮丸什么样子都很可爱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "喵呜，这、这只是一笔交易，完事了你还要把我变回去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "嗯，我记着呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "唔喵……门是关着的，要我背着你跳阳台进去吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "当然要先敲门，我们可是正经的客人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "呜喵，敲什么门呀，怪麻烦的……就依你这一次。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "叮咚——叮咚——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "你们找谁，唔，是猫？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "呼，还好不是优纪，我们是来、是来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "来给|101|送礼物的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "没错，呜喵，我们来送礼物，送完就走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "原来是|101|的朋友，请进。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "贝歌，你怎么在这里，我们该排练了。\n你们是谁，到这里来做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "好险好险，我还以为是优纪发现我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "看你的反应，我更想见优纪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "你们是最近新推出的……新品潮玩吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "你们的制作工艺看起来很特别，不像普通的潮玩。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "哼哼，被你发现了，你很敏锐哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "我是「兔儿爷」——一种古老的彩塑泥偶。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "我知道我知道，你不是普通的泥塑，是一种非非非……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "「国家级非物质文化遗产。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "完全听不懂你在说什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不得不说，我承认你的口才不错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "或许可以做我的伴唱，你们愿意留下来吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "不、不行，我们送完了礼物就走，说好了的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "没关系，反正我们还有时间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "而且，还没见到那个名为「|101|」的主人，多少有些遗憾呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "可是、可是这样下去，优纪她……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，是谁在叫我呀~\n呀！——粮丸，是变小的粮丸！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸小将",
          "text": "呜哇，你不要过来，不要过来，喵呜呜~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "才不要放过这个机会呢，谁让你以前仗着那么大只的个子欺负我们~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "这里总是能发生很多有趣的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "没错，这就是|101||103|的魅力。\n走吧，我们去排练，毕竟是我们准备的超级惊喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "我也可以参加吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "当然，我们需要你的帮助。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35026041",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "「兔儿爷」在手办世界的冒险，就这样拉开了帷幕——",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
